  "body": "Commanding an elevated position with sweeping sea views across Red Beach, this substantial residence delivers an exceptional lifestyle for large families, multi-generational living, or those seeking flexible accommodation options. Set on a generous 1,093sqm (more or less) site with an impressive 527sqm (approx) floor area, this is a home where space, versatility and breathtaking outlooks come together in perfect harmony.\r\n\r\nWhether you're searching for room to accommodate the extended family, a home that effortlessly adapts as life changes, or simply a property where everyone has their own space, this home delivers in every sense.\r\n\r\nOn the ground floor, you'll find a fully self-contained one-bedroom apartment complete with its own kitchen, bathroom and living area - ideal for extended family, guests, independent teenagers, or an additional income stream. This level also features an internal access double garage, an additional bedroom, a spacious studio, a second bathroom and a separate laundry, providing endless flexibility for those working from home, running a business or simply needing extra room.\r\n\r\nThe heart of the home is located on the first floor, where generous open-plan living, dining and a beautifully modern kitchen flow effortlessly onto wrap-around decking. Whether you're entertaining friends or enjoying a quiet morning coffee, the elevated position showcases expansive sea views stretching across Red Beach and the Hauraki Gulf. Three spacious bedrooms, a family bathroom and separate toilet complete this level.\r\n\r\nOccupying the top floor is a true parents' retreat. The master suite enjoys its own private balcony, walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, creating a peaceful sanctuary to unwind while taking in the ever-changing coastal outlook. A further bedroom on this level offers additional accommodation for family or guests.\r\n\r\nPositioned in one of Red Beach's most sought-after locations, you're just moments from beautiful beaches, quality schools, local shops, cafés and motorway access, making daily life as convenient as it is enjoyable.\r\n\r\nHomes of this scale, flexibility and position are a rare find. Whether you're accommodating multiple generations, seeking space for growing families or simply looking for an exceptional coastal home with room for everyone, 34 Marellen Drive is a property that truly stands apart.",
